{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T00:49:16.120Z","ordinal":7105,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa1fe89bc6887d0978df378d164758f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The core standard is now audience-aware and defines radical candor without turning it into bluntness. Because candor is a universal agent behavior, the new invariant must also be copied byte-for-byte into every agent’s static constitution block; I’m applying that as a mechanical synchronization, then I’ll verify prefix identity."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789001353760,"completed_at_ms":1789001356120}}
