{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:42:06.577Z","ordinal":7182,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa218efd50087d09e09eea9b6642683","status":"completed","call_id":"call_wRXUJ2KOIxGgczTG9RjYawEU","name":"exec","input":"const remove = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Delete File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/modern-cli-tools.md\\n*** End Patch\";\nconst add = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/modern-cli-tools.md\\n+# Modern CLI Tools\\n+\\n+## Outcome\\n+\\n+Use fast, structured tools when they are installed and fit the repository. Repository-native commands, task runners, and required wrappers take priority. A missing preferred tool is a reason to use a safe fallback, not to install software or stop the task.\\n+\\n+| Need | Prefer when available | Practical fallback |\\n+| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n+| Search text | `rg` | platform search tool |\\n+| Discover files | `fd` | platform file discovery |\\n+| Read source | `bat` | plain file reader |\\n+| Inspect directories | `eza` | directory listing tool |\\n+| Query JSON | `jq` | repository script or structured reader |\\n+| Inspect Git changes | `git` with `delta` as pager | plain `git diff` |\\n+| Filter an interactive choice | `fzf` | explicit non-interactive selection |\\n+| Work with GitHub | `gh` | purpose-built connector or API |\\n+| Navigate interactively | `zoxide` | explicit working directory |\\n+\\n+## Selection\\n+\\n+- Prefer structured output when another command or agent will consume the result.\\n+- Use non-interactive commands for automation.\\n+- Preserve the repository's wrapper, task runner, working-directory, and environment conventions.\\n+- Avoid a pipeline when one tool can perform the filter or transformation directly.\\n+- Confirm visible GitHub mutations immediately before running them.\\n+\\n+Examples are illustrative, not mandatory:\\n+\\n+```bash\\n+rg -n \\\"pattern\\\" src\\n+fd -e md . docs\\n+jq '.scripts' package.json\\n+git diff --stat\\n+gh pr status\\n+```\\n*** End Patch\";\nawait tools.apply_patch(remove);\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(add));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","create_time":1789008107.066121}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:42:06.706Z","ordinal":7183,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-91ed3e27-09da-4811-bcc5-9dec1561dbb1","changes":{"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/modern-cli-tools.md":{"type":"delete","content":"# Modern CLI Tools Reference (`modern-cli-tools`)\n\n**Status:** Mandatory Directive across all agents, skills, and subagents.\n**Purpose:** Replace legacy POSIX/Unix shell builtins with high-performance, modern CLI tools in terminal executions and shell commands.\n\n---\n\n## Directives & Tool Substitutions\n\n| Task / Operation | Preferred Modern Tool | Legacy Tool to Avoid | Command Example |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **File Viewing & Syntax Highlighting** | `bat` | `cat`, `less`, `more` | `bat -n src/main.rs` |\n| **Directory Navigation** | `zoxide` (`z`) | `cd` | `z callisto` or `zoxide query <dir>` |\n| **Code & Pattern Search** | `ripgrep` (`rg`) | `grep`, `egrep` | `rg \"fn handle_request\" src/` |\n| **File & Directory Discovery** | `fd` | `find` | `fd -e rs -e toml` |\n| **Directory Formatting & Tree View** | `eza` (or `exa`) | `ls`, `tree` | `eza --tree --level=2` |\n| **Git Diffs & Code Inspection** | `delta` | `diff`, raw `git diff` | `git diff | delta` |\n| **JSON Querying & Transformations** | `jq` | `python -m json.tool`, `sed` | `jq '.dependencies' package.json` |\n| **Interactive Choice Filtering** | `fzf` | Manual interactive selection | `fd | fzf` |\n| **GitHub Workflow & Operations** | `gh` CLI | Manual curl GitHub API calls | `gh pr status` |\n\n---\n\n## Tool Usage Details\n\n### 1. `bat` (File Viewing)\n- Displays file contents with syntax highlighting and line numbers.\n- For plain output without line decorations: `bat -p <file>`\n- For specific line ranges: `bat -r 10:40 <file>`\n\n### 2. `zoxide` (Smart Directory Navigation)\n- Remembers frequently used directories and jumps via fuzzy matching.\n- Query path without changing directory: `zoxide query <name>`\n\n### 3. `ripgrep` (`rg`) (Code & Pattern Search)\n- Respects `.gitignore` automatically, extremely fast multi-threaded search.\n- Filter by file type: `rg -t rust \"pattern\"` or `rg -t ts \"pattern\"`\n- Search literal string: `rg -F \"string\"`\n\n### 4. `fd` (File & Directory Discovery)\n- Fast, user-friendly alternative to `find`.\n- Search hidden files: `fd -H \"pattern\"`\n- Search extensions: `fd -e md`\n\n### 5. `eza` (Directory Formatting)\n- Modern replacement for `ls` with grid, tree, long format, git status integration.\n- List with details and git state: `eza -la --git`\n- Tree view: `eza --tree --level=3`\n\n### 6. `delta` (Diff Inspection)\n- Syntax-highlighting pager for git diff output.\n- Side-by-side diff: `git diff | delta -s`\n\n### 7. `jq` (JSON Processing)\n- Query, format, filter JSON files and command output streams.\n- Format file in-place: `jq . file.json > tmp.json && mv tmp.json file.json`\n\n### 8. `gh` (GitHub Operations)\n- Interact with GitHub repos, issues, pull requests, releases, and actions workflows directly.\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nD /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/modern-cli-tools.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1789008126621,"completed_at_ms":1789008126706}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:42:06.724Z","ordinal":7184,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","session_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","root_turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","response_id":"resp_0c3176283919dd68016aa218eac52487d09c0a65eac2b64fdf","usage":{"input_tokens":194335,"cached_input_tokens":193920,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":570,"reasoning_output_tokens":102,"total_tokens":194905},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":3642789,"cached_input_tokens":3427456,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":17555,"reasoning_output_tokens":5511,"total_tokens":3660344},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":107652658,"cached_input_tokens":105452544,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":484931,"reasoning_output_tokens":158166,"total_tokens":108137589}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:42:06.804Z","ordinal":7185,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-0ed5552a-8374-4978-a578-2067ce1a3a71","changes":{"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/modern-cli-tools.md":{"type":"add","content":"# Modern CLI Tools\n\n## Outcome\n\nUse fast, structured tools when they are installed and fit the repository. Repository-native commands, task runners, and required wrappers take priority. A missing preferred tool is a reason to use a safe fallback, not to install software or stop the task.\n\n| Need | Prefer when available | Practical fallback |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Search text | `rg` | platform search tool |\n| Discover files | `fd` | platform file discovery |\n| Read source | `bat` | plain file reader |\n| Inspect directories | `eza` | directory listing tool |\n| Query JSON | `jq` | repository script or structured reader |\n| Inspect Git changes | `git` with `delta` as pager | plain `git diff` |\n| Filter an interactive choice | `fzf` | explicit non-interactive selection |\n| Work with GitHub | `gh` | purpose-built connector or API |\n| Navigate interactively | `zoxide` | explicit working directory |\n\n## Selection\n\n- Prefer structured output when another command or agent will consume the result.\n- Use non-interactive commands for automation.\n- Preserve the repository's wrapper, task runner, working-directory, and environment conventions.\n- Avoid a pipeline when one tool can perform the filter or transformation directly.\n- Confirm visible GitHub mutations immediately before running them.\n\nExamples are illustrative, not mandatory:\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"pattern\" src\nfd -e md . docs\njq '.scripts' package.json\ngit diff --stat\ngh pr status\n```\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/modern-cli-tools.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1789008126750,"completed_at_ms":1789008126804}}
