{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:52:53.471Z","ordinal":7375,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-b96fcc1c-f562-4427-8de7-cc54673c8009","changes":{"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/ranger/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"ranger\",\n-  \"version\": \"3.2.0\",\n+  \"version\": \"3.2.1\",\n   \"description\": \"Bug hunting for Rust, TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, and Go. Confirms reachable defects, searches semantic siblings, and routes structural families for architectural correction.\",\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/sentinel/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Gate · **Output:** `verdict@3` · **Version:** 2.1.0\n+**Stage:** Gate · **Output:** `verdict@3` · **Version:** 2.1.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/smith/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Code · **Output:** code, `implementation-review@2`, `verdict@3` · **Version:** 2.4.0\n+**Stage:** Code · **Output:** code, `implementation-review@2`, `verdict@3` · **Version:** 2.4.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/scribe/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Spec · **Output:** `spec@1` · **Version:** 3.3.0\n+**Stage:** Spec · **Output:** `spec@1` · **Version:** 3.3.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/scribe/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"scribe\",\n-  \"version\": \"3.3.0\",\n+  \"version\": \"3.3.1\",\n   \"description\": \"Specification plugin. Drafts and gates testable specs, checks whole-system architecture, detects drift, and turns Ranger findings or Smith implementation reviews into structural corrections. Skills: draft-spec, verify-spec, spec-drift, audit-spec, audit-architecture, gate-spec, correct-spec, architect.\",\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/muse/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Design · **Output:** `spec@1` · **Version:** 1.0.0\n+**Stage:** Design · **Output:** `spec@1` · **Version:** 1.0.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/navigator/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"navigator\",\n-  \"version\": \"2.3.0\",\n+  \"version\": \"2.3.1\",\n   \"description\": \"Planning plugin. Decomposes specs into sequenced, bite-sized implementation plans with an implementation approach, exact code as a baseline, and the tests proving each criterion — no write-test-first mandate. Tasks are sized to compilation boundaries, not a clock-time estimate. No TBDs. A developer with zero domain context can execute the plan mechanically.\",\n@@ -21,2 +21,2 @@\n   ]\n-}\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+}\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/mason/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"mason\",\n-  \"version\": \"3.2.0\",\n+  \"version\": \"3.2.1\",\n   \"description\": \"Build, audit, and behaviorally evaluate plugins; design shared schemas and scaffold conformant agents. Skills: scaffold-plugin, audit-plugin, design-schema, scaffold-subagent, evaluate.\",\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/sentinel/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"sentinel\",\n-  \"version\": \"2.1.0\",\n+  \"version\": \"2.1.1\",\n   \"description\": \"Cross-cutting verification gate. Confirms any stage artifact meets its criteria before the next stage begins. Implements the sentinel protocol: recon \\u2192 verify \\u2192 exit-gate with retry-with-feedback.\",\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/ranger/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Cross-cutting · **Output:** `finding-report@2` · **Version:** 3.2.0\n+**Stage:** Cross-cutting · **Output:** `finding-report@2` · **Version:** 3.2.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/muse/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"muse\",\n-  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n+  \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n   \"description\": \"Component specification plugin. Turns UI/design intent into unambiguous, testable component specs — props, variants, per-state behavior, and accessibility criteria as testable propositions, gated before planning. Audits the spec, not the implementation — see ranger's accessibility hazard taxonomy for code-level scanning.\",\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/navigator/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Plan · **Output:** `plan@1` · **Version:** 2.3.0\n+**Stage:** Plan · **Output:** `plan@1` · **Version:** 2.3.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/mason/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@\n \n-**Stage:** Meta · **Output:** plugin artifacts and evaluations · **Version:** 3.2.0\n+**Stage:** Meta · **Output:** plugin artifacts and evaluations · **Version:** 3.2.1\n \n","move_path":null},"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/weaver/plugin.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -3,3 +3,3 @@\n   \"name\": \"weaver\",\n-  \"version\": \"3.0.1\",\n+  \"version\": \"3.0.2\",\n   \"description\": \"Need definition plugin. Captures and structures requirements before implementation begins. Integrates with GitHub Issues by default; extensible to any issue tracker that produces the requirement@1 schema. Skills: capture-need, clarify-requirement, prioritize-backlog, connect-requirement, audit-backlog.\",\n@@ -20,2 +20,2 @@\n   ]\n-}\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+}\n","move_path":null},"/Users/gab