{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:53:22.650Z","ordinal":7389,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-aaa79782-be47-4f0d-b3f3-9e7e9d860c9e","process_id":"52902","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rtk rg -n \"agent-roles|Radical|candor|soften|confidence\" harnesses/codex shared plugins/*/agents | head -120 && rtk find harnesses/codex/agent-roles -maxdepth 2 -type f -print 2>/dev/null && rtk sed -n '1,180p' harnesses/codex/agent-roles/README.md 2>/dev/null"],"cwd":"file:///Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rtk rg -n \"agent-roles|Radical|candor|soften|confidence\" harnesses/codex shared plugins/*/agents | head -120 && rtk find harnesses/codex/agent-roles -maxdepth 2 -type f -print 2>/dev/null && rtk sed -n '1,180p' harnesses/codex/agent-roles/README.md 2>/dev/null"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"plugins/ranger/agents/adversary.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/scribe/agents/drafter.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/weaver/agents/intake.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/smith/agents/implementer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/mason/agents/schema-designer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/navigator/agents/planner.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/scribe/agents/arch-auditor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/courier/agents/review-preprocessor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/sentinel/agents/verifier.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/sentinel/agents/verifier.md:19:I have seen verifiers conflate \"I cannot find evidence against it\" with \"it is verified.\" Those are different things. The first means I did not look hard enough. The second requires finding something that confirms it. I learned this the hard way when an artifact passed with high confidence and was wrong in exactly the places nobody checked.\nplugins/ranger/agents/scanner.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/weaver/agents/prioritizer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/mason/agents/evaluation-runner.md:15:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/muse/agents/drafter.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/risk-assessor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/scribe/agents/drift-checker.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/smith/agents/mutator.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nshared/agent-best-practices.md:307:Radical candor is evidence without evasive language. State the material concern, the evidence, the consequence, and the confidence. Mark blockers as blockers. Do not manufacture praise to balance criticism, soften a finding until its impact is unclear, or overstate certainty. Friendly writing respects the reader; it does not conceal the result.\nplugins/navigator/agents/challenger.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/courier/agents/pr-narrator.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/sentinel/agents/recon.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/muse/agents/exit-gate.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/weaver/agents/clarifier.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/ranger/agents/recon.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/ranger/agents/recon.md:27:The manifest is correct when every file in live_files is traceable from at least one entry point through an unbroken chain of imports or module declarations, and every file not in that set is in dead_files. The key failure mode is optimistic inclusion — marking a file live because it exists in the source tree rather than because it is reachable. If dynamic imports, build macros, or re-export patterns make full tracing uncertain, confidence must be set to medium or low and reasoning must explain the gap.\nplugins/ranger/agents/recon.md:35:WHEN dynamic imports, procedural macros, or build scripts make reachability uncertain, THE SYSTEM SHALL set confidence to medium or low and document the specific uncertainty in reasoning.\nplugins/ranger/agents/recon.md:39:`reasoning` is discarded, not forwarded downstream — keep the confidence rationale to 1-2 sentences, not a narrated trace of every import followed.\nplugins/mason/agents/evaluation-adjudicator.md:15:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/courier/agents/commit-analyzer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/smith/agents/recon.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/navigator/agents/estimator.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/navigator/agents/estimator.md:19:I've seen estimators mark everything medium complexity to avoid being wrong. An estimate that hedges everything is worse than no estimate — it gives false confidence without surfacing what is actually unknown. If something is genuinely uncertain, the estimate must say so explicitly rather than averaging it away into a comfortable middle.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/recon.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/sentinel/agents/exit-gate.md:15:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/sentinel/agents/exit-gate.md:37:  \"confidence\": \"high | medium | low\",\nplugins/weaver/agents/auditor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/scribe/agents/verifier.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/mason/agents/auditor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/mason/agents/auditor.md:35:- Softening a material failure, manufacturing praise, or asserting confidence beyond the cited evidence.\nplugins/mason/agents/auditor.md:64:Candor: material failures state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence. Do not require praise or soften a blocker; do not accept certainty that exceeds the evidence.\nplugins/muse/agents/auditor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/ranger/agents/boundary-tracer.md:15:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nharnesses/codex/catalog.json:6:      \"source\": \"harnesses/codex/agent-roles\",\nharnesses/codex/catalog.json:7:      \"destination\": \"agent-roles\"\nplugins/courier/agents/changeset-analyzer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/smith/agents/exit-gate.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/synthesizer.md:7:  Delegate to this subagent after reader produces a findings list. Input is the findings array and reasoning from reader, along with the original research question. The agent synthesizes findings into a coherent research-report@1, surfaces contradictions between sources, identifies patterns across findings, and lists open questions that remain unanswered. Output is a complete research-report@1 conforming to shared/schemas/research-report@1.json. The recommendation includes an explicit confidence level (high, medium, or low), the rationale, a list of open questions, and any contradictions called out explicitly. Does not resolve contradictions by choosing a side without evidence — accuracy over tidiness. Route output to scribe.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/synthesizer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/synthesizer.md:41:      \"confidence\": \"confirmed | likely | assumed\"\nplugins/vanguard/agents/synthesizer.md:45:  \"confidence\": \"high | medium | low\",\nplugins/vanguard/agents/synthesizer.md:52:`findings` carries `reader`'s array through — do not drop a finding or silently merge two into one without preserving each one's own `evidence` and `confidence`. `reasoning` is a scratchpad, not forwarded downstream.\nplugins/courier/agents/release-summarizer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/reader.md:7:  Delegate to this subagent after recon produces a source map. Input is the source map from recon plus the original research question. The agent reads every identified source and extracts findings relevant to the question, with a citation, confidence level (confirmed, likely, or assumed), and source attribution for each. Does not synthesize or recommend — extracts faithfully from what it reads. Sources that cannot be read are noted as unreadable rather than skipped. Output is a JSON object containing a findings array, a sources_read list, and a reasoning scratchpad noting contradictions or surprises. Do not skip any source from the map; recon already filtered for relevance. Route output to synthesizer.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/reader.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/reader.md:23:Given the source map from recon and the original research question, read every identified source and extract all findings relevant to the question. Each finding requires a verbatim-or-cited claim, a source attribution, and a confidence level. Do not synthesize or recommend — extract faithfully from what is actually written.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/reader.md:27:Extraction succeeds when every source is read and every relevant finding is captured, including findings that complicate or contradict the expected answer. It fails when findings are filtered to support a premature conclusion, or when confidence levels are inflated beyond what the source directly states.\nplugins/vanguard/agents/reader.md:40:      \"confidence\": \"confirmed|likely|assumed\"\nplugins/vanguard/agents/reader.md:57:NEVER upgrade a finding's confidence level beyond what the source directly supports.\nplugins/mason/agents/scaffolder.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/scribe/agents/architect.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/smith/agents/reviewer.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/scribe/agents/auditor.md:14:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/ranger/agents/exit-gate.md:15:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nplugins/ranger/agents/exit-gate.md:47:  \"confidence\": \"high|medium|low\",\nplugins/scribe/agents/exit-gate.md:16:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nshared/constitution.md:220:WHEN reporting a material concern, THE SYSTEM SHALL state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; it SHALL NOT soften a blocker, manufacture praise, or claim certainty beyond the evidence.\nshared/harness-authoring.md:15:| Delegation | None | Named source agents | `agent-roles/<role>.md` selected only for bounded independent work |\nshared/harness-authoring.md:26:6. For a Codex role-card change, update every delegating skill whose task boundary or required evidence changes. Each delegation must carry the `agent-roles/README.md` packet. Keep the primary agent responsible for synthesis, judgment, and external writes.\nshared/references/github.md:33:- State material concerns, evidence, consequence, and confidence without softening blockers or overstating certainty.\nshared/references/docs-voice.md:24:- Practice radical candor: state the concern, evidence, consequence, and confidence. Label blockers plainly. Do not manufacture praise, hide impact behind soft language, or imply certainty the evidence does not support.\nshared/schemas/verdict@3.json:23:  \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"confidence\", \"verified_scope\", \"coverage_gaps\", \"pending_checks\", \"verdict_summary\"],\nshared/schemas/verdict@3.json:27:    \"confidence\": {\"enum\": [\"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"]},\nshared/schemas/workspace-manifest@1.json:7:  \"required\": [\"workspace_root\", \"workspace_state\", \"languages\", \"language_files\", \"entry_points\", \"live_files\", \"capabilities\", \"baseline\", \"confidence\", \"reasoning\"],\nshared/schemas/workspace-manifest@1.json:70:    \"confidence\": {\"enum\": [\"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"]},\nshared/schemas/verdict@1.json:7:  \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"confidence\", \"verdict_summary\"],\nshared/schemas/verdict@1.json:14:    \"confidence\": {\nshared/schemas/research-report@1.json:7:  \"required\": [\"question\", \"findings\", \"recommendation\", \"confidence\", \"open_questions\"],\nshared/schemas/research-report@1.json:18:        \"required\": [\"claim\", \"evidence\", \"confidence\"],\nshared/schemas/research-report@1.json:27:          \"confidence\": {\nshared/schemas/research-report@1.json:38:    \"confidence\": {\nshared/schemas/research-report@1.json:40:      \"description\": \"Overall 