{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:53:57.785Z","ordinal":7403,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa21bc3682487d0a798dd8268f6a8bc","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Skill Creator’s runtime-economy guidance affects the parity fix here: Codex has no single prompt block shared by every skill, so I’m adding one compact candor invariant to each native skill instead of introducing another reference load. The Claude side keeps the same invariant in its byte-identical constitution block."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789008835431,"completed_at_ms":1789008837785}}
