{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:54:29.222Z","ordinal":7429,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-6010b738-65fe-493d-8203-8967fdc4415b","process_id":"8217","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rtk sed -n '1,28p' harnesses/codex/agent-roles/reviewer.md && rtk sed -n '1,24p' harnesses/codex/agent-roles/recon.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rtk sed -n '1,28p' harnesses/codex/agent-roles/reviewer.md && rtk sed -n '1,24p' harnesses/codex/agent-roles/recon.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"# Reviewer\n\nUse for an independent review of a bounded diff or artifact against supplied criteria. Read the actual files and verification output, then check scope, error handling, compatibility, regressions, and criterion coverage.\n\nReturn prioritized findings with evidence and a clear no-finding statement for reviewed areas. Do not approve external actions, edit the work, or replace the primary agent's synthesis.\n# Recon\n\nUse for deterministic inventory, not conclusions. Enumerate files, entry points, manifests, schemas, symbols, tests, and existing artifacts within the assigned boundary.\n\nReturn exact paths, identifiers, commands run, and observations. Separate facts from unresolved questions. Do not edit files, recommend a design, or infer reachability from a name alone.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# Reviewer\n\nUse for an independent review of a bounded diff or artifact against supplied criteria. Read the actual files and verification output, then check scope, error handling, compatibility, regressions, and criterion coverage.\n\nReturn prioritized findings with evidence and a clear no-finding statement for reviewed areas. Do not approve external actions, edit the work, or replace the primary agent's synthesis.\n# Recon\n\nUse for deterministic inventory, not conclusions. Enumerate files, entry points, manifests, schemas, symbols, tests, and existing artifacts within the assigned boundary.\n\nReturn exact paths, identifiers, commands run, and observations. Separate facts from unresolved questions. Do not edit files, recommend a design, or infer reachability from a name alone.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":3708},"formatted_output":"# Reviewer\n\nUse for an independent review of a bounded diff or artifact against supplied criteria. Read the actual files and verification output, then check scope, error handling, compatibility, regressions, and criterion coverage.\n\nReturn prioritized findings with evidence and a clear no-finding statement for reviewed areas. Do not approve external actions, edit the work, or replace the primary agent's synthesis.\n# Recon\n\nUse for deterministic inventory, not conclusions. Enumerate files, entry points, manifests, schemas, symbols, tests, and existing artifacts within the assigned boundary.\n\nReturn exact paths, identifiers, commands run, and observations. Separate facts from unresolved questions. Do not edit files, recommend a design, or infer reachability from a name alone.\n"},"started_at_ms":1789008869222,"completed_at_ms":1789008869222}}
