{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:54:45.930Z","ordinal":7441,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa21bf200b087d08fd5ea064fd8f682","status":"completed","call_id":"call_YUKvlEi442O4anVvln9WX8Fh","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/harnesses/codex/agent-roles/README.md\\n@@\\n | Evidence | Commands, source locations, test results, or citations required to support the result. |\\n+| Reporting | State material concerns, evidence, consequence, and confidence directly; do not soften blockers, manufacture praise, or overclaim certainty. |\\n | Completion | The condition that returns control to the primary agent. |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","create_time":1789008877.067092}}}
