ion plugin. Captures and structures requirements before implementation begins. Integrates with GitHub Issues by default; extensible to any issue tracker that produces the requirement@1 schema. Skills: capture-need, clarify-requirement, prioritize-backlog, connect-requirement, audit-backlog.\",\n   \"author\": {\n     \"name\": \"Gabriel Castro\",\n@@ -18,4 +18,4 @@\n   \"produces\": [\n     \"requirement@1\"\n   ]\n-}\n+}\n  +2 -2\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","create_time":1789009076.824868}}}
