{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:59:37.766Z","ordinal":7690,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa21d0f82b087d0aa88bb0ca072bab2","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Implemented the documentation and runtime-guidance overhaul.\n\nKey outcomes:\n\n- Added radical-candor and evidence-led reference rules to [constitution.md](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/constitution.md).\n- Reworked runtime references around applicability, signals, refutation, and disposition.\n- Reduced shared-reference prose by roughly 25%: 11,924 → 8,983 words.\n- Modernized [docs-voice.md](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/docs-voice.md), [github.md](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/github.md), and the PR template.\n- Removed the orphaned `mcp-protocol.md`; no runtime routes referenced it.\n- Updated Rust, TypeScript, Python, and Go hazard, architecture, boundary, and tooling guidance.\n- Applied the same candor invariant to all 44 Claude agents and 30 Codex skills.\n- Updated root/plugin READMEs, architecture, contributor guidance, manifests, and changelogs.\n- Prepared patch release metadata: marketplace `4.4.1` and patch bumps for all ten plugins.\n- Rebuilt the generated Codex distribution.\n\nValidation passes:\n\n- 37 unit tests\n- Version and documentation consistency\n- Codex marketplace drift check\n- All 30 Codex skill validations\n- Reference size/density checks\n- ShellCheck\n- `git diff --check`\n- All 44 Claude constitution blocks are byte-identical\n\nThe changes remain uncommitted and unpushed."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789009167729,"completed_at_ms":1789009177766}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:59:37.771Z","ordinal":7691,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa21d0f82b087d0aa88bb0ca072bab2","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Implemented the documentation and runtime-guidance overhaul.\n\nKey outcomes:\n\n- Added radical-candor and evidence-led reference rules to [constitution.md](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/constitution.md).\n- Reworked runtime references around applicability, signals, refutation, and disposition.\n- Reduced shared-reference prose by roughly 25%: 11,924 → 8,983 words.\n- Modernized [docs-voice.md](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/docs-voice.md), [github.md](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/github.md), and the PR template.\n- Removed the orphaned `mcp-protocol.md`; no runtime routes referenced it.\n- Updated Rust, TypeScript, Python, and Go hazard, architecture, boundary, and tooling guidance.\n- Applied the same candor invariant to all 44 Claude agents and 30 Codex skills.\n- Updated root/plugin READMEs, architecture, contributor guidance, manifests, and changelogs.\n- Prepared patch release metadata: marketplace `4.4.1` and patch bumps for all ten plugins.\n- Rebuilt the generated Codex distribution.\n\nValidation passes:\n\n- 37 unit tests\n- Version and documentation consistency\n- Codex marketplace drift check\n- All 30 Codex skill validations\n- Reference size/density checks\n- ShellCheck\n- `git diff --check`\n- All 44 Claude constitution blocks are byte-identical\n\nThe changes remain uncommitted and unpushed."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a088c6-48bb-7040-a264-83f7cdb1775a","create_time":1789009161.061613,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
