{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:05:00.960Z","ordinal":7788,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08942-aaa6-70d0-9a29-9e5a737952eb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa21e4c651c87d08faa1efbb0a101c1","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"One valid `changeset@2` covers the coordinated change:\n\n- Summary: “Agents now use concise, evidence-led guidance, test heuristic refutations, and report blockers candidly across Claude and Codex.”\n- Impact: `behavior-change`\n- Semver: `patch`\n- Files: 231\n- Criteria: `unlinked`\n- No breaking changes\n\nThe repository has no changeset persistence directory, so the root and plugin changelogs remain the durable records.\n\nProposed PR:\n\n- Repository: `orin-dx/agent-plugins`\n- Branch: `fix/evidence-led-agent-guidance`\n- Base: `main`\n- Labels: `enhancement`, `documentation`\n- Commit/title: `fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led`\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n\n- Reframe runtime references around outcomes, applicability, confirming and refuting evidence, and explicit dispositions. This removes project-specific mandates and cuts shared-reference prose by about 25%.\n- Add a radical-candor invariant to all 44 Claude agents and all 30 Codex skills, with matching Mason scaffolding and audit coverage.\n- Align Courier PR guidance, root and plugin documentation, patch versions, changelogs, and generated Codex artifacts for marketplace 4.4.1.\n\n## Verification\n\n- [x] `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` — 37 tests passed.\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree.\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — all documented skills resolve.\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 34 references pass.\n- [x] `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated distribution is current.\n- [x] Skill validation — all 30 native Codex skills passed.\n- [x] `shellcheck -x -P scripts scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — passed.\n- [x] `git diff --check` — passed.\n\n## Risk and follow-up\n\n- All ten plugins receive patch bumps because their runtime instructions changed; schemas and invocation contracts remain compatible.\n- `shared/references/mcp-protocol.md` is removed because it had no runtime or documentation call sites.\n```\n\nConfirm that I should stage all current changes, create the commit above, push the branch, and open this PR."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789009484419,"completed_at_ms":1789009500960}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T03:05:00.964Z","ordinal":7789,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa21e4c651c87d08faa1efbb0a101c1","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"One valid `changeset@2` covers the coordinated change:\n\n- Summary: “Agents now use concise, evidence-led guidance, test heuristic refutations, and report blockers candidly across Claude and Codex.”\n- Impact: `behavior-change`\n- Semver: `patch`\n- Files: 231\n- Criteria: `unlinked`\n- No breaking changes\n\nThe repository has no changeset persistence directory, so the root and plugin changelogs remain the durable records.\n\nProposed PR:\n\n- Repository: `orin-dx/agent-plugins`\n- Branch: `fix/evidence-led-agent-guidance`\n- Base: `main`\n- Labels: `enhancement`, `documentation`\n- Commit/title: `fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led`\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n\n- Reframe runtime references around outcomes, applicability, confirming and refuting evidence, and explicit dispositions. This removes project-specific mandates and cuts shared-reference prose by about 25%.\n- Add a radical-candor invariant to all 44 Claude agents and all 30 Codex skills, with matching Mason scaffolding and audit coverage.\n- Align Courier PR guidance, root and plugin documentation, patch versions, changelogs, and generated Codex artifacts for marketplace 4.4.1.\n\n## Verification\n\n- [x] `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` — 37 tests passed.\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree.\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — all documented skills resolve.\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 34 references pass.\n- [x] `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated distribution is current.\n- [x] Skill validation — all 30 native Codex skills passed.\n- [x] `shellcheck -x -P scripts scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — passed.\n- [x] `git diff --check` — passed.\n\n## Risk and follow-up\n\n- All ten plugins receive patch bumps because their runtime instructions changed; schemas and invocation contracts remain compatible.\n- `shared/references/mcp-protocol.md` is removed because it had no runtime or documentation call sites.\n```\n\nConfirm that I should stage all current changes, create the commit above, push the branch, and open this PR."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08942-aaa6-70d0-9a29-9e5a737952eb","create_time":1789009457.936158,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
