-guidance\",\"isDraft\":false,\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTlbj4c8AAAACtkps9g\",\"name\":\"documentation\",\"description\":\"Improvements or additions to documentation\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTlbj4c8AAAACtkptDw\",\"name\":\"enhancement\",\"description\":\"New feature or request\",\"color\":\"a2eeef\"}],\"number\":9,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/agent-plugins/actions/runs/34509318479/job/102979212061\",\"name\":\"validate\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-10T17:37:14Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"Validate\"}],\"title\":\"fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/agent-plugins/pull/9\"}\n"},"started_at_ms":1789061852286,"completed_at_ms":1789061852874}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T17:37:32.919Z","ordinal":7887,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a08c65-6ef7-74d1-b65e-c1317a3a7eff","call_id":"call_klLF7IxcZzVwKc3QLefbIE2Y","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Reframe runtime references around outcomes, applicability, confirming and refuting evidence, and explicit dispositions. This removes project-specific mandates and cuts shared-reference prose by about 25%.\\n- Add a radical-candor invariant to all 44 Claude agents and all 30 Codex skills, with matching Mason scaffolding and audit coverage.\\n- Align Courier PR guidance, root and plugin documentation, patch versions, changelogs, and generated Codex artifacts for marketplace 4.4.1.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- [x] `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` — 37 tests passed.\\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree.\\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — all documented skills resolve.\\n- [x] `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 34 references pass.\\n- [x] `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated distribution is current.\\n- [x] Skill Creator validation — all 30 native Codex skills passed.\\n- [x] `shellcheck -x -P scripts scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — passed.\\n- [x] `git diff --check` — passed.\\n\\n## Risk and follow-up\\n\\n- All ten plugins receive patch bumps because their runtime instructions changed; schemas and invocation contracts remain compatible.\\n- `shared/references/mcp-protocol.md` is removed because it had no runtime or documentation call sites.\\n\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-09-10T17:36:02Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"gabe@techworx.dev\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjc0Nw==\",\"login\":\"castrog\",\"name\":\"Gabe Castro\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-09-10T17:36:02Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led\",\"oid\":\"85f6245e14b94c25850955b68008e537b544b90f\"}],\"headRefName\":\"fix/evidence-led-agent-guidance\",\"isDraft\":false,\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTlbj4c8AAAACtkps9g\",\"name\":\"documentation\",\"description\":\"Improvements or additions to documentation\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOTlbj4c8AAAACtkptDw\",\"name\":\"enhancement\",\"description\":\"New feature or request\",\"color\":\"a2eeef\"}],\"number\":9,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/agent-plugins/actions/runs/34509318479/job/102979212061\",\"name\":\"validate\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-10T17:37:14Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"Validate\"}],\"title\":\"fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/agent-plugins/pull/9\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08c63-15f4-7e83-8640-aa486d938a84","create_time":1789061852.919875}}}
