,\"title\":\"fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/orin-dx/agent-plugins/pull/9\"}\nok fetched (2 new refs)\naead634 fix(ecosystem): make agent guidance evidence-led (#9)\ncf27386 docs: refresh Mermaid diagrams and visual standard\nc9e474a feat(ecosystem): release evidence-aware verification (#8)\n"},"started_at_ms":1789062991658,"completed_at_ms":1789062993195}}
