{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:06:17.535Z","ordinal":8430,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa2f18e1e4887d08fc8e1615d4dff84","status":"completed","call_id":"call_e7RnJw7jlyOYV6r0kuGA9Npn","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/ranger/agents/scanner.md\\n@@\\n-Full scan: load both `shared/references/hazards/<language>.md` and `shared/references/hazards/<language>-boundaries.md` for each detected language.\\n-Focused scan: load only the language file containing the requested taxonomy; T7 and T10 use the boundary file.\\n+Full scan: for each detected language, load its pair: `hazards/rust.md` and `hazards/rust-boundaries.md`; `hazards/typescript.md` and `hazards/typescript-boundaries.md`; `hazards/python.md` and `hazards/python-boundaries.md`; or `hazards/go.md` and `hazards/go-boundaries.md`, all beneath `shared/references/`.\\n+Focused scan: load only the applicable file from that list; T7 and T10 use the boundary file.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/navigator/skills/plan/SKILL.md\\n@@\\n-- **Challenge a draft plan** — `challenger` checks coverage, order, specificity, batch size, and error handling. Amended plans receive the same review.\\n+- **Challenge a draft plan** — `challenger` checks coverage, order, specificity, batch size, error handling, and shared-interface siblings. It loads `shared/references/verification/interface-coverage.md` when a contract or implementation changes. Amended plans receive the same review.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/harnesses/codex/plugins/navigator/skills/plan/SKILL.md\\n@@\\n-5. Challenge the plan for orphaned criteria, invalid ordering, missing error paths, over-sized batches, and test gaps. Revise only concrete blockers; cap review churn at two rounds.\\n+5. Challenge the plan for orphaned criteria, invalid ordering, missing error paths, over-sized batches, test gaps, and shared-interface siblings. When a contract or implementation changes, use `shared/references/verification/interface-coverage.md` to derive syntactic and semantic candidates from live code and architecture. Revise only concrete blockers; cap review churn at two rounds.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/harnesses/codex/catalog.json\\n@@\\n-    {\\n-      \\\"id\\\": \\\"navigator\\\",\\n-      \\\"runtime_files\\\": [\\n-        \\\"shared/schemas/plan@1.json\\\",\\n-        \\\"shared/schemas/spec@1.json\\\"\\n-      ]\\n-    },\\n+    {\\n+      \\\"id\\\": \\\"navigator\\\",\\n+      \\\"runtime_files\\\": [\\n+        \\\"shared/schemas/plan@1.json\\\",\\n+        \\\"shared/schemas/spec@1.json\\\",\\n+        \\\"shared/references/verification/interface-coverage.md\\\"\\n+      ]\\n+    },\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08c77-4ac1-77a0-808c-4dde87d268d4","create_time":1789063562.073217}}}
