{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:22:43.166Z","ordinal":8990,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa2f56e3c3087d0b7ad457b2a8b3846","status":"completed","call_id":"call_QusiX4eqsmQSPu4V4XsPldPv","name":"exec","input":"const results = await Promise.all([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk bat --style=plain tests/test_reference_reachability.py shared/references/README.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":18000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk git diff -- scripts/check-mermaid.sh .github/workflows/validate.yml harnesses/codex/catalog.json marketplace.json CHANGELOG.md plugins/navigator/CHANGELOG.md plugins/mason/CHANGELOG.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":30000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk git diff -- plugins/ranger/agents/scanner.md plugins/navigator/agents/challenger.md plugins/navigator/skills/plan/SKILL.md harnesses/codex/plugins/navigator/skills/plan/SKILL.md plugins/mason/agents/auditor.md plugins/mason/agents/scaffolder.md harnesses/codex/plugins/mason/skills/audit-plugin/SKILL.md harnesses/codex/plugins/mason/skills/scaffold-plugin/SKILL.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":35000})\n]); for (let i=0;i<results.length;i++) text(`---RESULT ${i+1}---\\n${results[i].output}`);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08c77-4ac1-77a0-808c-4dde87d268d4","create_time":1789064554.159669}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:22:43.286Z","ordinal":8991,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08c77-4ac1-77a0-808c-4dde87d268d4","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-27d77016-9cbf-4f31-ba23-72eb6b8aa102","process_id":"48704","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rtk git diff -- scripts/check-mermaid.sh .github/workflows/validate.yml harnesses/codex/catalog.json marketplace.json CHANGELOG.md plugins/navigator/CHANGELOG.md plugins/mason/CHANGELOG.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rtk git diff -- scripts/check-mermaid.sh .github/workflows/validate.yml harnesses/codex/catalog.json marketplace.json CHANGELOG.md plugins/navigator/CHANGELOG.md plugins/mason/CHANGELOG.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":".github/workflows/validate.yml |  3 +++\n CHANGELOG.md                   |  9 +++++++++\n harnesses/codex/catalog.json   | 30 +++++++++++++++---------------\n marketplace.json               | 18 +++++++++---------\n plugins/mason/CHANGELOG.md     |  6 ++++++\n plugins/navigator/CHANGELOG.md |  8 ++++++++\n scripts/check-mermaid.sh       |  6 +++++-\n 7 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)\n\nChanges:\n\n.github/workflows/validate.yml\n@@ -41,3 +41,6 @@ jobs:\n \n       - name: Check reference file size\n         run: ./scripts/check-reference-size.sh\n+\n+      - name: Check reference reachability\n+        run: python3 -m unittest tests/test_reference_reachability.py -v\n  +3 -0\n\nCHANGELOG.md\n@@ -3,6 +3,15 @@\n All notable changes to the Wisp Plugins ecosystem are documented here.\n Individual plugin changelogs live in `plugins/<plugin-id>/CHANGELOG.md`.\n \n+## [4.4.2] - 2026-09-10 — Concern-first reference routing\n+\n+- Reorganized shared references by cognitive concern, with language as the filename only for language-specific evidence. Removed four redundant language indexes.\n+- Updated Claude/AGY and Codex runtime paths, catalogs, authoring docs, and generated packaging inputs together.\n+- Added CI coverage for broken exact paths and runtime references with no caller.\n+- Mermaid validation now reports renderer and network failures when no parser error is present.\n+- Corrected Navigator's Codex workflow to apply the same syntax-and-architecture interface coverage as its Claude/AGY challenger.\n+- Replaced stale claims about grep-only scanning and deterministic implementer discovery with the evidence-led behavior the references require.\n+\n ## [4.4.1] - 2026-09-09 — Direct, evidence-led guidance\n \n - Added a shared radical-candor rule: report material concerns with evidence, consequence, and calibrated confidence; do not soften blockers or manufacture praise.\n  +9 -0\n\nharnesses/codex/catalog.json\n@@ -19,14 +19,14 @@\n         \"shared/schemas/release-artifact@2.json\",\n         \"shared/schemas/requirement@1.json\",\n         \"shared/schemas/spec@1.json\",\n-        \"shared/references/changesets.md\",\n-        \"shared/references/conventional-commits.md\",\n-        \"shared/references/docs-voice.md\"\n+        \"shared/references/delivery/changesets.md\",\n+        \"shared/references/delivery/commits.md\",\n+        \"shared/references/authoring/voice.md\"\n       ]\n     },\n     {\n       \"id\": \"mason\",\n-      \"runtime_files\": [\"shared/schemas\", \"shared/harness-authoring.md\", \"shared/references/behavioral-evaluation.md\"]\n+      \"runtime_files\": [\"shared/schemas\", \"shared/harness-authoring.md\", \"shared/references/evaluation/behavioral.md\"]\n     },\n     {\n       \"id\": \"muse\",\n@@ -34,7 +34,7 @@\n     },\n     {\n       \"id\": \"navigator\",\n-      \"runtime_files\": [\"shared/schemas/plan@1.json\", \"shared/schemas/spec@1.json\"]\n+      \"runtime_files\": [\"shared/schemas/plan@1.json\", \"shared/schemas/spec@1.json\", \"shared/references/verification/interface-coverage.md\"]\n     },\n     {\n      