{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:24:48.215Z","ordinal":9094,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08c77-4ac1-77a0-808c-4dde87d268d4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa2f5ea603c87d0a4d8d48ad67403a9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Implemented on `refactor/reference-taxonomy`.\n\n- Reorganized 30 references by cognitive concern; removed four redundant language indexes.\n- Updated all Claude/AGY and Codex runtime paths and rebuilt `dist/codex`.\n- Added concern-first, path-validity, and runtime-caller CI checks.\n- Fixed the missing Codex Navigator interface-sibling review.\n- Prepared marketplace `4.4.2` and patch bumps for eight affected plugins.\n- Preserved immutable `changeset@2` bytes with one documented legacy-path exception.\n- Improved Mermaid failure diagnostics.\n\nKey files: [reference map](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/references/README.md), [constitution](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/constitution.md), [integrity tests](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/tests/test_reference_integrity.py).\n\nValidation is green: 40 unit tests, wiring, versions, skill docs, reference size/integrity, Codex build parity, ShellCheck, Mermaid rendering, and diff checks.\n\nNothing is committed or pushed yet. Confirm and I’ll create the commit and PR."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789064682446,"completed_at_ms":1789064688215}}
