{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:14:33.353Z","ordinal":9322,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa3019746d087d083175e207849dcfc","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The fix has two coupled parts: correct the live pointers, then strengthen validation so exact paths, relative links, and retired wildcard names are all checked. The constitution wording change affects the shared static prefix, so I’ll update every authored agent copy together and verify byte identity rather than changing only the top-level prose."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789067671307,"completed_at_ms":1789067673353}}
