{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:14:37.525Z","ordinal":9324,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa3019953d487d0bc150e91a8c44305","status":"completed","call_id":"call_vC4IH3SWjp7mfE6SzFDGXzTx","name":"exec","input":"const rs = await Promise.all([\n  tools.exec_command({\n    cmd: \"rtk bat --style=plain --number plugins/sentinel/skills/gate/SKILL.md plugins/ranger/agents/adversary.md plugins/ranger/agents/boundary-tracer.md plugins/ranger/agents/scanner.md plugins/courier/README.md tests/test_reference_integrity.py\",\n    workdir: \"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\n    yield_time_ms: 30000,\n    max_output_tokens: 16000\n  }),\n  tools.exec_command({\n    cmd: \"rtk rg -n \\\"WHEN an agent requires a shared reference file|load only the file for its cognitive phase|one <load_first>|one exact path|only the reference file|named reference file\\\" plugins harnesses shared AGENTS.md ARCHITECTURE.md CONTRIBUTING.md README.md\",\n    workdir: \"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\n    yield_time_ms: 30000,\n    max_output_tokens: 10000\n  }),\n  tools.exec_command({\n    cmd: \"rtk rg --files tools scripts tests | rtk sort\",\n    workdir: \"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\n    yield_time_ms: 30000,\n    max_output_tokens: 5000\n  }),\n  tools.exec_command({\n    cmd: \"rtk bat --style=plain --number shared/schemas/changeset@2.json harnesses/codex/catalog.json\",\n    workdir: \"/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins\",\n    yield_time_ms: 30000,\n    max_output_tokens: 12000\n  })\n]);\nfor (const r of rs) text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","create_time":1789067646.951837}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:14:37.576Z","ordinal":9325,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","session_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","root_turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","response_id":"resp_0c3176283919dd68016aa3017ed3c087d0938faaabd5ad0c74","usage":{"input_tokens":41391,"cached_input_tokens":35456,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1550,"reasoning_output_tokens":1113,"total_tokens":42941},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":76979,"cached_input_tokens":69248,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2000,"reasoning_output_tokens":1267,"total_tokens":78979},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":137379503,"cached_input_tokens":134508800,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":602545,"reasoning_output_tokens":201813,"total_tokens":137982048}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:14:37.657Z","ordinal":9326,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-6af25dd0-5ce7-4916-a5e3-06b9a5c4e433","process_id":"46154","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rtk rg -n \"WHEN an agent requires a shared reference file|load only the file for its cognitive phase|one <load_first>|one exact path|only the reference file|named reference file\" plugins harnesses shared AGENTS.md ARCHITECTURE.md CONTRIBUTING.md README.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rtk rg -n \"WHEN an agent requires a shared reference file|load only the file for its cognitive phase|one <load_first>|one exact path|only the reference file|named reference file\" plugins harnesses shared AGENTS.md ARCHITECTURE.md CONTRIBUTING.md README.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"ARCHITECTURE.md:244:**Progressive context loading** — each agent loads only the reference file for its cognitive concern.\nARCHITECTURE.md:246:- A `<load_first>` block names one exact path. The first directory identifies the concern; a language filename narrows language-specific evidence.\nAGENTS.md:47:4. **Progressive context loading** — one `<load_first>` block per agent, naming only the reference file for its cognitive phase.\nplugins/mason/README.md:109:| `<load_first>` correctness | Present whenever an agent's goal implies a lookup it can't do from memory; its named reference file actually resolves |\nshared/constitution.md:72:WHEN an agent requires a shared reference file, it SHALL load only the file for its cognitive phase — not all reference files.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"ARCHITECTURE.md:244:**Progressive context loading** — each agent loads only the reference file for its cognitive concern.\nARCHITECTURE.md:246:- A `<load_first>` block names one exact path. The first directory identifies the concern; a language filename narrows language-specific evidence.\nAGENTS.md:47:4. **Progressive context loading** — one `<load_first>` block per agent, naming only the reference file for its cognitive phase.\nplugins/mason/README.md:109:| `<load_first>` correctness | Present whenever an agent's goal implies a lookup it can't do from memory; its named reference file actually resolves |\nshared/constitution.md:72:WHEN an agent requires a shared reference file, it SHALL load only the file for its cognitive phase — not all reference files.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":1958},"formatted_output":"ARCHITECTURE.md:244:**Progressive context loading** — each agent loads only the reference file for its cognitive concern.\nARCHITECTURE.md:246:- A `<load_first>` block names one exact path. The first directory identifies the concern; a language filename narrows language-specific evidence.\nAGENTS.md:47:4. **Progressive context loading** — one `<load_first>` block per agent, naming only the reference file for its cognitive phase.\nplugins/mason/README.md:109:| `<load_first>` correctness | Present whenever an agent's goal implies a lookup it can't do from memory; its named reference file actually resolves |\nshared/constitution.md:72:WHEN an agent requires a shared reference file, it SHALL load only the file for its cognitive phase — not all reference files.\n"},"started_at_ms":1789067677657,"completed_at_ms":1789067677657}}
