{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:17:41.879Z","ordinal":9397,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa30245847487d0874db37e3d39fa7c","status":"completed","call_id":"call_xr1kdOzwyl9TnLG1Ft2NoQDo","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/tests/test_reference_integrity.py\\n@@\\n-IMMUTABLE_PATH_EXCEPTIONS = {\\n-    (\\\"shared/schemas/changeset@2.json\\\", \\\"shared/references/\\\" \\\"changesets.md\\\"),\\n+IMMUTABLE_PATH_EXCEPTIONS = {\\n+    (\\n+        \\\"shared/schemas/changeset@2.json\\\",\\n+        \\\"shared/references/\\\" \\\"changesets\\\" \\\".md\\\",\\n+    ): \\\"shared/references/delivery/changesets.md\\\",\\n@@\\n     def test_exact_reference_paths_exist(self) -> None:\\n@@\\n         self.assertEqual(broken, [])\\n+\\n+    def test_immutable_path_exceptions_have_live_replacements(self) -> None:\\n+        invalid: list[str] = []\\n+        for (source_name, historical), replacement in IMMUTABLE_PATH_EXCEPTIONS.items():\\n+            source = REPOSITORY_ROOT / source_name\\n+            if historical not in source.read_text(encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\"):\\n+                invalid.append(f\\\"{source_name} no longer contains {historical}\\\")\\n+            if not (REPOSITORY_ROOT / replacement).is_file():\\n+                invalid.append(f\\\"replacement missing: {replacement}\\\")\\n+            live_callers = [\\n+                path.relative_to(REPOSITORY_ROOT).as_posix()\\n+                for path, contents in self.sources.items()\\n+                if path != source and is_runtime_caller(path) and historical in contents\\n+            ]\\n+            if live_callers:\\n+                invalid.append(f\\\"live callers still use {historical}: {live_callers}\\\")\\n+        self.assertEqual(invalid, [])\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/CHANGELOG.md\\n@@\\n-- Added CI coverage for broken exact paths and runtime references with no caller.\\n+- Added CI coverage for broken exact paths, local Markdown links, retired pointer forms, immutable-path replacements, and runtime references with no caller.\\n@@\\n-- Replaced stale claims about grep-only scanning and deterministic implementer discovery with the evidence-led behavior the references require.\\n+- Replaced stale claims about grep-only scanning and deterministic implementer discovery with the evidence-led behavior the references require; Ranger now names every selectable hazard path exactly.\\n+- Corrected Sentinel's verdict-schema link and clarified that one `<load_first>` block may select the smallest relevant set of focused references.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/mason/CHANGELOG.md\\n@@\\n-- Reference conformance now includes exact-path and runtime-caller validation.\\n+- Reference conformance now includes exact paths, local Markdown links, retired pointer forms, immutable-path replacements, and runtime callers.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/ranger/CHANGELOG.md\\n@@\\n-- Scanner documentation now describes candidate-signal enumeration without implying grep output is evidence of a defect.\\n+- Scanner documentation now describes candidate-signal enumeration without assuming every reference supplies a literal grep command.\\n+- Adversary and boundary-tracer name every selectable hazard reference exactly.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/courier/CHANGELOG.md\\n@@\\n - Commit, PR, review, changeset, release, and voice guidance now load through concern-first reference paths in both harnesses.\\n+- Changeset documentation now names the exact delivery reference instead of a bare filename.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/sentinel/CHANGELOG.md\\n@@\\n — sentinel\\n \\n+## [2.1.2] - 2026-09-10\\n+\\n+### Fixed\\n+- The gate skill's verdict-schema link now resolves from its nested skill directory.\\n+\\n ## [2.1.1] - 2026-09-09\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/sentinel/plugin.json\\n@@\\n-  \\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.1\\\",\\n+  \\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.2\\\",\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/plugins/sentinel/README.md\\n@@\\n-**Stage:** Gate · **Output:** `verdict@3` · **Version:** 2.1.1\\n+**Stage:** Gate · **Output:** `verdict@3` · **Version:** 2.1.2\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/harnesses/codex/plugins/sentinel/.codex-plugin/plugin.json\\n@@\\n-  \\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.1\\\",\\n+  \\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.2\\\",\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/marketplace.json\\n@@\\n-      \\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.1\\\",\\n+      \\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.2\\\",\\n*** End Patch\";\nconst result = await tools.apply_patch(patch);\ntext(result);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","create_time":1789067827.601261}}}
