{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:19:51.100Z","ordinal":9509,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa302d2e5d487d0a1b74a5b6c794db3","status":"completed","call_id":"call_zewXGVivhDWX0wrLgAQQNIJV","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/shared/agent-best-practices.md\\n@@\\n-[Only present when the agent uses a shared reference file for its phase.]\\n+[Only present when the agent uses shared references for its phase.]\\n@@\\n-- `shared/references/<concern>/*.md` — **runtime**. Agents load these on demand via `<load_first>`.\\n+- `shared/references/<concern>/*.md` — **focused guidance**. Runtime agents load exact dependencies via `<load_first>`; authoring-only guides stay out of runtime chains.\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/harnesses/codex/plugins/ranger/skills/audit/SKILL.md\\n@@\\n-2. Load only the matching Rust, TypeScript/JavaScript, Python, or Go hazard reference. Use the narrow T7/T10 pack only for those taxonomies.\\n+2. Load only the matching Rust, TypeScript/JavaScript, Python, or Go hazard references. Use the boundary reference only for T7 and T10.\\n*** End Patch\";\nconst result = await tools.apply_patch(patch);\ntext(result);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","create_time":1789067982.592403}}}
