{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:24:22.530Z","ordinal":9608,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa303e11e0087d0b4cc4e46452f0f96","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Fixed the live reference and documentation inconsistencies.\n\n- Corrected Sentinel’s broken schema link and bumped Sentinel to 2.1.2.\n- Replaced Ranger’s retired wildcard paths with exact language-specific references.\n- Updated Ranger scanning guidance to support signals and tool-appropriate searches—not only literal grep patterns.\n- Clarified that one `<load_first>` block may select a small focused reference set.\n- Replaced Courier’s ambiguous bare reference names.\n- Aligned Claude/AGY and Codex Ranger terminology.\n- Added integrity checks for Markdown/HTML links, schema paths, retired pointer forms, runtime callers, and immutable-path replacements in [test_reference_integrity.py](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/tests/test_reference_integrity.py).\n- Rebuilt Codex distribution artifacts and updated changelogs.\n\nValidation passed:\n\n- 44 tests\n- 20 Mermaid diagrams\n- ShellCheck\n- Version and skill consistency\n- Reference size and integrity\n- Codex build drift\n- `git diff --check`\n\nThe old path inside immutable `changeset@2` remains byte-unchanged, but its current replacement is explicitly mapped and no live agent uses the retired path. Navigator’s broader planning-policy/schema redesign remains a separate change because it requires a contract migration."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789068257216,"completed_at_ms":1789068262530}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:24:22.535Z","ordinal":9609,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa303e11e0087d0b4cc4e46452f0f96","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Fixed the live reference and documentation inconsistencies.\n\n- Corrected Sentinel’s broken schema link and bumped Sentinel to 2.1.2.\n- Replaced Ranger’s retired wildcard paths with exact language-specific references.\n- Updated Ranger scanning guidance to support signals and tool-appropriate searches—not only literal grep patterns.\n- Clarified that one `<load_first>` block may select a small focused reference set.\n- Replaced Courier’s ambiguous bare reference names.\n- Aligned Claude/AGY and Codex Ranger terminology.\n- Added integrity checks for Markdown/HTML links, schema paths, retired pointer forms, runtime callers, and immutable-path replacements in [test_reference_integrity.py](/Users/gabe/Projects/agent-plugins/tests/test_reference_integrity.py).\n- Rebuilt Codex distribution artifacts and updated changelogs.\n\nValidation passed:\n\n- 44 tests\n- 20 Mermaid diagrams\n- ShellCheck\n- Version and skill consistency\n- Reference size and integrity\n- Codex build drift\n- `git diff --check`\n\nThe old path inside immutable `changeset@2` remains byte-unchanged, but its current replacement is explicitly mapped and no live agent uses the retired path. Navigator’s broader planning-policy/schema redesign remains a separate change because it requires a contract migration."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08cbd-ae2c-7ca0-9da8-fdd13eaa77fa","create_time":1789068246.800629,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
