eaver/agents/auditor.md\nM  plugins/weaver/plugin.json\nM  scripts/check-mermaid.sh\nM  shared/agent-best-practices.md\nM  shared/constitution.md\nM  shared/hooks/subagent-start.sh\nA  shared/references/README.md\nR  shared/references/boundary-value-shapes.md -> shared/references/architecture/boundary-values.md\nR  shared/references/go-smells.md -> shared/references/architecture/go.md\nR  shared/references/python-smells.md -> shared/references/architecture/python.md\nR  shared/references/architecture-remediation.md -> shared/references/architecture/remediation.md\nR  shared/references/rust-smells.md -> shared/references/architecture/rust.md\nR  shared/references/typescript-smells.md -> shared/references/architecture/typescript.md\nR  dist/codex/plugins/smith/shared/references/code-comments.md -> shared/references/authoring/comments.md\nR  shared/references/orin-visual-standard.md -> shared/references/authoring/diagrams.md\nR  shared/references/docs-voice.md -> shared/references/authoring/voice.md\nR  shared/references/changesets.md -> shared/references/delivery/changesets.md\nR  shared/references/conventional-commits.md -> shared/references/delivery/commits.md\nR  shared/references/github.md -> shared/references/delivery/github.md\nR  shared/references/behavioral-evaluation.md -> shared/references/evaluation/behavioral.md\nD  shared/references/go.md\nR  shared/references/go-hazards-t7-t10.md -> shared/references/hazards/go-boundaries.md\nR  shared/references/go-hazards.md -> shared/references/hazards/go.md\nR  shared/references/python-hazards-t7-t10.md -> shared/references/hazards/python-boundaries.md\nR  shared/references/python-hazards.md -> shared/references/hazards/python.md\nR  shared/references/rust-hazards-t7-t10.md -> shared/references/hazards/rust-boundaries.md\nR  dist/codex/plugins/ranger/shared/references/rust-hazards.md -> shared/references/hazards/rust.md\nR  shared/references/typescript-hazards-t7-t10.md -> shared/references/hazards/typescript-boundar