{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:27:43.801Z","ordinal":9733,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08cc8-c424-79d1-be30-c563c97745c1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa304a7751887d0abb0ad929cc9cfd3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Everything is staged and verified. Please confirm this exact publication payload.\n\nCommit:\n\n```text\nrefactor(ecosystem): organize references by cognitive concern\n\nAlign reference paths with the decision each agent makes while keeping Claude/AGY and Codex runtime packages consistent. Add integrity checks so moved paths, local links, schema routes, and immutable compatibility mappings cannot drift silently.\n```\n\nPR title:\n\n```text\nrefactor: organize shared references by cognitive concern\n```\n\nPR body:\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n\n- Organize shared references around hazards, architecture, verification, delivery, authoring, evaluation, workspace, and tooling concerns.\n- Remove redundant language indexes and update Claude/AGY, Codex, and generated distribution paths together.\n- Clarify focused context loading and align Ranger’s candidate-search and boundary-reference guidance across harnesses.\n- Add integrity checks for reference and schema paths, Markdown and HTML links, retired names, immutable-path replacements, and runtime callers.\n- Publish the associated patch releases through marketplace 4.4.2.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py'` — 44 tests passed\n- `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree\n- `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — documented skills match source directories\n- `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 31 references satisfy the size cap\n- `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated Codex distribution is current\n- `shellcheck -x -P scripts ...` — passed\n- `bash scripts/check-mermaid.sh` — all 20 diagrams render\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\n## Compatibility\n\nPublished schema bytes remain unchanged. `changeset@2` retains its historical path text, while integrity tests map it to the current delivery reference and ensure no live runtime caller uses the retired path.\n\nNavigator’s broader planning-policy and schema redesign remains a separate follow-up.\n```\n\nTarget: `orin-dx/agent-plugins`, base `main`, head `refactor/reference-taxonomy`, no labels, ready for review. Confirm and I’ll commit, push, and open it."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789068455483,"completed_at_ms":1789068463801}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:27:43.803Z","ordinal":9734,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0c3176283919dd68016aa304a7751887d0abb0ad929cc9cfd3","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Everything is staged and verified. Please confirm this exact publication payload.\n\nCommit:\n\n```text\nrefactor(ecosystem): organize references by cognitive concern\n\nAlign reference paths with the decision each agent makes while keeping Claude/AGY and Codex runtime packages consistent. Add integrity checks so moved paths, local links, schema routes, and immutable compatibility mappings cannot drift silently.\n```\n\nPR title:\n\n```text\nrefactor: organize shared references by cognitive concern\n```\n\nPR body:\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n\n- Organize shared references around hazards, architecture, verification, delivery, authoring, evaluation, workspace, and tooling concerns.\n- Remove redundant language indexes and update Claude/AGY, Codex, and generated distribution paths together.\n- Clarify focused context loading and align Ranger’s candidate-search and boundary-reference guidance across harnesses.\n- Add integrity checks for reference and schema paths, Markdown and HTML links, retired names, immutable-path replacements, and runtime callers.\n- Publish the associated patch releases through marketplace 4.4.2.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py'` — 44 tests passed\n- `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree\n- `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — documented skills match source directories\n- `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 31 references satisfy the size cap\n- `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated Codex distribution is current\n- `shellcheck -x -P scripts ...` — passed\n- `bash scripts/check-mermaid.sh` — all 20 diagrams render\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\n## Compatibility\n\nPublished schema bytes remain unchanged. `changeset@2` retains its historical path text, while integrity tests map it to the current delivery reference and ensure no live runtime caller uses the retired path.\n\nNavigator’s broader planning-policy and schema redesign remains a separate follow-up.\n```\n\nTarget: `orin-dx/agent-plugins`, base `main`, head `refactor/reference-taxonomy`, no labels, ready for review. Confirm and I’ll commit, push, and open it."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08cc8-c424-79d1-be30-c563c97745c1","create_time":1789068453.191654,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:27:43.841Z","ordinal":9735,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08cc8-c424-79d1-be30-c563c97745c1","session_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","root_turn_id":"01a08cc8-c424-79d1-be30-c563c97745c1","response_id":"resp_0c3176283919dd68016aa304a4e1d487d09201e797f630cf69","usage":{"input_tokens":163994,"cached_input_tokens":158848,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":516,"reasoning_output_tokens":56,"total_tokens":164510},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1331302,"cached_input_tokens":1297280,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":4211,"reasoning_output_tokens":2247,"total_tokens":1335513},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":142108108,"cached_input_tokens":139106944,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":627907,"reasoning_output_tokens":214757,"total_tokens":142736015}}}
