{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:31:16.365Z","ordinal":9796,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0c3176283919dd68016aa3057dc9ac87d0bbc7d9e608dc3674","status":"completed","call_id":"call_6Wj4aHwY0lhKURshoATuhuIC","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: /private/tmp/agent-plugins-pr-10.md\\n+## Summary\\n+\\n+- Organize shared references around hazards, architecture, verification, delivery, authoring, evaluation, workspace, and tooling concerns.\\n+- Remove redundant language indexes and update Claude/AGY, Codex, and generated distribution paths together.\\n+- Clarify focused context loading and align Ranger’s candidate-search and boundary-reference guidance across harnesses.\\n+- Add integrity checks for reference and schema paths, Markdown and HTML links, retired names, immutable-path replacements, and runtime callers.\\n+- Publish the associated patch releases through marketplace 4.4.2.\\n+\\n+## Verification\\n+\\n+- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py'` — 44 tests passed\\n+- `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree\\n+- `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — documented skills match source directories\\n+- `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 31 references satisfy the size cap\\n+- `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated Codex distribution is current\\n+- `shellcheck -x -P scripts ...` — passed\\n+- `bash scripts/check-mermaid.sh` — all 20 diagrams render\\n+- `git diff --check` — passed\\n+\\n+## Compatibility\\n+\\n+Published schema bytes remain unchanged. `changeset@2` retains its historical path text, while integrity tests map it to the current delivery reference and ensure no live runtime caller uses the retired path.\\n+\\n+Navigator’s broader planning-policy and schema redesign remains a separate follow-up.\\n*** End Patch\";\nconst result = await tools.apply_patch(patch);\ntext(result);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08ccb-f163-7392-ba2c-d9cee9e1e662","create_time":1789068662.78247}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:31:16.487Z","ordinal":9797,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08ccb-f163-7392-ba2c-d9cee9e1e662","session_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","root_turn_id":"01a08ccb-f163-7392-ba2c-d9cee9e1e662","response_id":"resp_0c3176283919dd68016aa3057683ac87d09cab561df81257df","usage":{"input_tokens":171504,"cached_input_tokens":170624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":695,"reasoning_output_tokens":253,"total_tokens":172199},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1185393,"cached_input_tokens":1176704,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2869,"reasoning_output_tokens":1120,"total_tokens":1188262},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":143293501,"cached_input_tokens":140283648,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":630776,"reasoning_output_tokens":215877,"total_tokens":143924277}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:31:19.801Z","ordinal":9798,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a086d4-219f-74e1-8171-83f651770f25","turn_id":"01a08ccb-f163-7392-ba2c-d9cee9e1e662","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-9a2bacc9-7479-431b-a6f3-8f952b9d207e","changes":{"/private/tmp/agent-plugins-pr-10.md":{"type":"add","content":"## Summary\n\n- Organize shared references around hazards, architecture, verification, delivery, authoring, evaluation, workspace, and tooling concerns.\n- Remove redundant language indexes and update Claude/AGY, Codex, and generated distribution paths together.\n- Clarify focused context loading and align Ranger’s candidate-search and boundary-reference guidance across harnesses.\n- Add integrity checks for reference and schema paths, Markdown and HTML links, retired names, immutable-path replacements, and runtime callers.\n- Publish the associated patch releases through marketplace 4.4.2.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py'` — 44 tests passed\n- `bash scripts/check-versions.sh` — all 10 plugin versions agree\n- `bash scripts/check-skills-doc.sh` — documented skills match source directories\n- `bash scripts/check-reference-size.sh` — all 31 references satisfy the size cap\n- `python3 tools/build-codex-marketplace.py --check` — generated Codex distribution is current\n- `shellcheck -x -P scripts ...` — passed\n- `bash scripts/check-mermaid.sh` — all 20 diagrams render\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\n## Compatibility\n\nPublished schema bytes remain unchanged. `changeset@2` retains its historical path text, while integrity tests map it to the current delivery reference and ensure no live runtime caller uses the retired path.\n\nNavigator’s broader planning-policy and schema redesign remains a separate follow-up.\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /private/tmp/agent-plugins-pr-10.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1789068676371,"completed_at_ms":1789068679800}}
